report, preserving version identity, basis evidence, source locations and unresolved availability/package/semantic obligations.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"source-work-register.json\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Exactly the accepted report IDs occur once, with original and extraction hashes verified.\",\n        \"Sourced filing dates remain distinct from unknown publication and byte-vintage evidence.\",\n        \"No record is promoted to a gold accounting label or complete disclosure package.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P02\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Complete the bounded Apple case preparation\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P01\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G4\",\n        \"G5\",\n        \"G11\",\n        \"G12\",\n        \"G13\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC01\",\n        \"MC03\",\n        \"MC05\",\n        \"MC16\",\n        \"MC28\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Build a source-anchored annual/interim Apple case layer over the existing retained files: every inventoried note has an explicit modelling disposition, selected statement/note bridges are machine-checked, external incorporations remain visible, and known unidentified histories are preserved. Implement reusable extraction/context/reconciliation code rather than copying authored conclusions.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"case.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"All 13 annual and 10 interim notes have source anchors, linked quantities or explicit unresolved meaning, with no claim that dispositions alone close semantics.\",\n        \"Reconciliation uses source-bound values and exact rounding-aware expectations; wrong scale/sign/perimeter and broken source anchors are rejected.\",\n        \"Incorporated proxy/agreement and publication-version obligations are investigated using legitimate public sources where available, and unresolved obligations are specific.\",\n        \"Tests include real retained input and independent arithmetic/source checks; no full-company forecast is claimed.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p02.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P03\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Implement source lowering and shared IR\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P02\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G2\",\n        \"G12\",\n        \"G15\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC02\",\n        \"MC04\",\n        \"MC10\",\n        \"MC20\",\n        \"MC23\",\n        \"MC24\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Implement executable DSL source-to-IR lowering and an equivalent typed-library entrypoint for the declared Core 0 supported profile. Start with borrowing.acc and expand beyond an exact fixture lookup. Preserve package bindings, source context, assumptions and alternatives. Never label a JSON/schema parser as a semantic compiler.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"conformance.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Actual source programs lower through parsing, binding, package/type/context checks into validated shared IR.\",\n        \"Equivalent typed-library programs have matching semantics and changed valid inputs produce changed results rather than returning a frozen fixture.\",\n        \"Independent source variants and schema-valid negative programs test supported coverage and unsupported-operation errors.\",\n        \"Outstanding general-language, mapping and uncertainty support is explicitly enumerated; no full G2 closure by one profile.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p03.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P03\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P04\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Implement reconstruction and numerical operations\",\n      \"deps\": [\