balance sheet, income/OCI, cash-flow and equity outputs from common journals; preserve event failures and supported scenario/history branches. Apply a supported bounded path to the prepared real case without inventing absent facts.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"execution.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Run actual event inputs, not the expected-result fixture; independently check journals and all statement bridges.\",\n        \"Atomic rejection, duplicate events, economic funding default and unsupported operations have distinct outputs.\",\n        \"Role/date information checks stop future-data use in supported behaviour and measurement paths.\",\n        \"Real-company conditional calculations and any unresolved operation remain distinct from forecast accuracy and semantic completeness.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p05.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P05\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P06\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Enforce context, chronology and resolution\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P03\",\n        \"P01\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G12\",\n        \"G13\",\n        \"G14\",\n        \"G15\",\n        \"G16\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC02\",\n        \"MC05\",\n        \"MC06\",\n        \"MC07\",\n        \"MC10\",\n        \"MC11\",\n        \"MC14\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Implement context-aware mappings, partition checks, original/latest/harmonised evidence selection, category-specific uncertainty admission and query-dependent resolution checks for bounded supported cases; test their interactions.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"conformance.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Parent/group and basis mismatches, overlapping dimensions and unsupported measurement conversion are rejected.\",\n        \"Valid/invalid YTD subtraction, selective revisions, date-only policies and unknown source availability are tested.\",\n        \"Every supported uncertainty category has appropriate admission rules; unimplemented categories fail explicitly.\",\n        \"Changing horizon/scenario triggers grouping sufficiency checks; approximation needs declared error evidence.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p06.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P06\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P07\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Implement review, persistence and recovery\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P05\",\n        \"P06\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G17\",\n        \"G18\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC04\",\n        \"MC25\",\n        \"MC27\",\n        \"MC34\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Implement local evidence review transitions and persistent transactional company execution, immutable lineage, idempotent recovery and versioned migration. Preserve prior results under their original evidence views and invalidate dependent results after corrections.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"recovery.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Interrupted execution and replay match uninterrupted execution for the declared scope.\",\n        \"Duplicate/conflicting events, partial writes and migrations have tested failure and recovery behaviour.\",\n        \"Review correction invalidates the transitive dependents while preserving unrelated and historical results.\",\n        \"Stable branch/event identities and stochastic-stream requirements are implemented or explicitly unsupported.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p07.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P07\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P08\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Resolve authority and corporate-method obligations\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P02\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G4\",\n        \"G7\",\n        \"G8\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC06\",\n        \"MC15\",\n        \"MC17\",\n        \"MC19\",\n        \"MC29\",\n        \"MC30\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Prepare dated primary-authority support and implement or precisely specify the next supported corporate/financing operations: revenue, tax, leases, FX, complex groups and bonds. Inspect legitimate primary ASC/ASBE/IFRS-related authority and adopted research; preserve access blocks and jurisdiction limits. Choose a complete internally supportable operation slice and leave the wider queue visible.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"authority-and-methods.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Claims have inspected primary paragraph/section anchors and jurisdiction/effective-period limits; unavailable texts remain uninspected.\",\n        \"A supported operation slice has preconditions, recognition, measurement, state/posting effects, note links and exact multi-period cases.\",\n        \"Same-fact cross-standard comparisons explain supported differences; source absence is not silently replaced by company practice.\",\n        \"Missing methods and material unresolved interpretations are recorded as specific follow-up work; no professional engagement or paid data.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p08.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P08\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P09\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Extend bank methods\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P03\",\n        \"P08\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G7\",\n        \"G8\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC19\",\n        \"MC21\",\n        \"MC28\",\n        \"MC29\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Develop the next source-supported bank allowance/credit lifecycle and funding/capital operation slice, using the retained bank filings and exact synthetic cases. Explicitly separate IFRS 9/CECL and jurisdictional prudential requirements, deposits/funding/liquidity and management behaviour.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"bank-methods.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Inspect and archive legitimate primary support for each adopted method and period.\",\n        \"Multi-period cases reconcile allowance/accounting movements and separately justified capital quantities.\",\n        \"Illustrative prudential numbers are not promoted to actual jurisdictional rules.\",\n        \"Remaining lifecycle, calibration and regulatory coverage is listed with an executable next slice.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p09.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P09\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P10\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Extend insurance methods\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P03\",\n        \"P08\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G7\",\n        \"G8\",\n        \"G16\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC19\",\n        \"MC22\",\n        \"MC28\",\n        \"MC29\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Extend the short-duration insurer case through an internally supportable next operation slice toward general measurement, CSM, variable fees, transition, onerous groups and risk adjustment. Preserve separate gross/reinsurance recognition, eligibility, timing and asset interactions; inspect technical actuarial methods.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"insurance-methods.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Source-backed selected measurement/roll-forward operations have complete exact multi-period examples.\",\n        \"Reinsurance eligibility/timing and risk-transfer/nonperformance effects remain separate.\",\n        \"Risk-adjustment estimation is supported by a defined uncertainty method or left explicitly open.\",\n        \"CSM, variable-fee, transition and onerous-group gaps retain specific follow-up tasks when not implemented.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p10.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P10\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P11\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Exercise adapters and matched frontends\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P03\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G9\",\n        \"G2\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC23\",\n        \"MC25\",\n        \"MC31\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Exercise selected pinned Arelle, ACTUS, QuantLib, Docling and ledger interfaces on retained bounded inputs, using only available or project-local open-source dependencies. Build reproducible adapter exchanges and compare the DSL and typed frontend on the same shared model/tasks.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"integrations.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Each attempted adapter records exact version, actual executable input/output, unit/calendar conventions and failures.\",\n        \"Unavailable tools stay unavailable; inspection or import-only checks are not represented as completed integration.\",\n        \"Matched frontend semantic tests share the same model, accounting methods and runtime.\",\n        \"No human authoring/usability superiority is inferred without a separate study.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p11.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P11\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P12\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Prepare and exercise a bounded benchmark\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P02\",\n        \"P05\",\n        \"P06\",\n        \"P07\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G10\",\n        \"G5\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC28\",\n        \"MC33\"