k. Continue source/method preparation when chronology vetoes a historical test.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"forecast-evidence.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Research intent, default audit, baseline, promotion/veto rules, nonclaims and run manifest are written before empirical runs.\",\n        \"Historical tests use no later information and no unknown availability assumptions.\",\n        \"Joint weights/inference and unresolved probability mass are handled under an explicit justified measure.\",\n        \"Limited diagnostics do not establish forecast superiority, causal identification or continuous-inference validity.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p13.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P13\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P14\",\n      \"kind\": \"worker\",\n      \"name\": \"Integrate the design and independent-review preparation\",\n      \"deps\": [\n        \"P04\",\n        \"P07\",\n        \"P08\",\n        \"P09\",\n        \"P10\",\n        \"P11\",\n        \"P12\",\n        \"P13\"\n      ],\n      \"gaps\": [\n        \"G8\",\n        \"G10\",\n        \"G17\",\n        \"G18\"\n      ],\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"MC29\",\n        \"MC32\",\n        \"MC33\",\n        \"MC34\",\n        \"MC35\"\n      ],\n      \"objective\": \"Integrate supported implementation and method findings into the governing design, inspect the rendered manuscript, and update the master requirement/gap evidence and resume notes. Preserve equations, citations and source limits. Prepare narrow unsent review packets only for consequential internally exhausted judgments.\",\n      \"deliverables\": [\n        \"design-review.json\",\n        \"result.md\"\n      ],\n      \"criteria\": [\n        \"Rendered manuscript and source changes are inspected against the protected baseline with substantive omissions explained.\",\n        \"Specification, implementation, accounting, forecast and human-comprehension status stay distinct.\",\n        \"All eighteen gap categories and MC01–MC35 retain honest residual work and next actions.\",\n        \"No paid engagement, publication, external messages or generic human-review stop blocks independent internal work.\"\n      ],\n      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p14.py\",\n      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P14\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"verdict\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"PLAN\",\n        \"AGREE\",\n        \"REVISE\",\n        \"IMPLEMENTED\",\n        \"BLOCKED\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"steps\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"assumptions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"checks\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"issues\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"residuals\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"next_actions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"verdict\",\n    \"summary\",\n    \"steps\",\n    \"assumptions\",\n    \"checks\",\n    \"evidence\",\n    \"issues\",\n    \"residuals\",\n    \"next_actions\"\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
